Z||000010||stimpy||05-12-2000||07:46 PM||||Gotta chime in here. I think the line between rice-boy and lowrider is getting pretty blurry here.  At least lowriders have some type of legacy and history, opposed to the "euro" aka ricer look.  I personally enjoy checking out a nice clean lowrider and respect the time and effort (not to mention cash) that goes in to turning out a nice clean lowrider. This whole bashing the other guy cuz they ain't us...maybe it's just me, but it seems kinda tired.  ||||reg||1
